<!-- Transport legend -->
<mxCell id="leg" value="Transport Legend:&#xa;━━━  HTTP (external + Stripe webhook + internal reverse HTTP)&#xa;- - -  TCP @MessagePattern (apps/api → services, sync RPC)&#xa;·····  RabbitMQ @EventPattern (async fire-and-forget)&#xa;&#xa;Key ADRs: ADR-094 (3-transport model), ADR-108 (port consolidation), ADR-109 (choreography W-1)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="680" width="600" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

